{"text":"kuruntokai","n":186,"lines":["ஆர்கலி யேற்றொடு கார்தலை மணந்த","கொல்லைப் புனத்த முல்லை மென்கொடி","எயிறென முகையும் நாடற்குத்","துயிறுறந் தனவால் தோழியென் கண்ணே"],"tr":["ārkali yēṟṟoṭu kārtalai maṇanta","kollaip puṉatta mullai meṉkoṭi","eyiṟeṉa mukaiyum nāṭaṟkut","tuyiṟuṟan taṉavāl tōḻiyeṉ kaṇṇē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஒக்கூர் மாசாத்தியார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Okkūr Mācāttiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 9, veṇṭaḷai 4, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஆர்கலி","tr":"ārkali","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆர்","tr":"ār"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலி","tr":"kali"}]},{"text":"யேற்றொடு","tr":"yēṟṟoṭu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யேற்","tr":"yēṟ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றொடு","tr":"ṟoṭu"}]},{"text":"கார்தலை","tr":"kārtalai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கார்","tr":"kār"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலை","tr":"talai"}]},{"text":"மணந்த","tr":"maṇanta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மணந்","tr":"maṇan"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]}],[{"text":"கொல்லைப்","tr":"kollaip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொல்","tr":"kol"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லைப்","tr":"laip"}]},{"text":"புனத்த","tr":"puṉatta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புனத்","tr":"puṉat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"முல்லை","tr":"mullai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முல்","tr":"mul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"மென்கொடி","tr":"meṉkoṭi","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மென்","tr":"meṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடி","tr":"koṭi"}]}],[{"text":"எயிறென","tr":"eyiṟeṉa","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"எயி","tr":"eyi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றென","tr":"ṟeṉa"}]},{"text":"முகையும்","tr":"mukaiyum","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முகை","tr":"mukai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யும்","tr":"yum"}]},{"text":"நாடற்குத்","tr":"nāṭaṟkut","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டற்","tr":"ṭaṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"குத்","tr":"kut"}]}],[{"text":"துயிறுறந்","tr":"tuyiṟuṟan","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"துயி","tr":"tuyi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றுறந்","tr":"ṟuṟan"}]},{"text":"தனவால்","tr":"taṉavāl","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தன","tr":"taṉa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வால்","tr":"vāl"}]},{"text":"தோழியென்","tr":"tōḻiyeṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியென்","tr":"ḻiyeṉ"}]},{"text":"கண்ணே","tr":"kaṇṇē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கண்","tr":"kaṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணே","tr":"ṇē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஆர்கலி","parts":[{"text":"ஆர்கலி","lemma":"ஆர்கலி","gloss":"roaring thunder"}],"gloss":"roaring thunder"},{"surface":"ஏற்றொடு","parts":[{"text":"ஏற்றொடு","lemma":"ஏற்றொடு","gloss":"with thunder"}],"gloss":"with thunder","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கார்","parts":[{"text":"கார்","lemma":"கார்","gloss":"rainy season"}],"gloss":"rainy season"},{"surface":"தலை","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"beginning"}],"gloss":"beginning"},{"surface":"மணந்த","parts":[{"text":"மணந்த","lemma":"மணந்த","gloss":"united"}],"gloss":"united","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கொல்லைப்","parts":[{"text":"கொல்லைப்","lemma":"கொல்லைப்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"புனத்த","parts":[{"text":"புனத்த","lemma":"புனத்த","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"முல்லை","parts":[{"text":"முல்லை","lemma":"முல்லை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மென்கொடி","parts":[{"text":"மென்கொடி","lemma":"மென்கொடி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"எயிறு","parts":[{"text":"எயிறு","lemma":"எயிறு","gloss":"teeth"}],"gloss":"teeth"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"to say"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix (as/like)"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"முகையும்","parts":[{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"to bud"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual future suffix"}],"gloss":"which buds"},{"surface":"நாடற்கு","parts":[{"text":"நாடற்கு","lemma":"நாடற்கு","gloss":"to the man of the land"}],"gloss":"to the man of the land","split_unverified":true}]},{"words":[{"surface":"துயிறுறந்","parts":[{"text":"துயிறுறந்","lemma":"துயிறுறந்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தனவால்","parts":[{"text":"தனவால்","lemma":"தனவால்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழியென்","parts":[{"text":"தோழியென்","lemma":"தோழியென்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கண்ணே","parts":[{"text":"கண்ணே","lemma":"கண்ணே","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true}],"literal":"Roaring thunder with, rainy season's beginning united / backyard forest-clearing's jasmine soft vine / teeth-like buds, to the man of such land / sleep abandoned, O friend, my eyes!","translation":"The rainy season has begun, accompanied by roaring thunder. In the forest clearings, the soft vines of the wild jasmine are budding like teeth. For the lord of this land, O friend, my eyes have completely abandoned sleep.","modern":"முழங்குகின்ற இடியோடு கார்காலம் தொடங்கியுள்ளது. கொல்லைப் புறத்துத் தோட்டத்திலுள்ள முல்லையின் மெல்லிய கொடிகள் பற்களைப் போல அரும்புகின்றன. இத்தகைய நாட்டின் தலைவனுக்காக, தோழியே, என் கண்கள் தூக்கத்தைத் துறந்துவிட்டன.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her close friend during the rainy season, which belongs to the Mullai landscape. The hero had promised to return before the onset of the rains, but he has not yet arrived. She points out that the rainy season has commenced with roaring thunder, and the wild jasmine vines in the forest clearings are budding. These white buds look like sharp, white teeth, mockingly laughing at her loneliness. Because of her longing for the lord of this land, her eyes have completely lost their sleep. The key words are 'ஆர்கலி' (roaring thunder), 'முல்லை' (wild jasmine), 'எயிறு' (teeth), and 'துயில்' (sleep).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}